@startuml SupplyChain_seq1
' REVIEWED_MAIN_2026_05_13: aligned to current merged code; large-investment retained pending simplification merge.

title Corda Vault Software Supply Chain — Sequence

autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam wrapWidth 220

box "Developers" #F5F5F5
actor "Developers" as Dev
participant "Developer Laptops" as Laptop
end box

box "Source and Dependencies" #EEF6FF
participant "npm and Rust Package\nRepositories" as Repos
participant "GitHub Repositories" as GitHub
end box

box "CI/CD" #FFF6E5
participant "Jenkins Pipeline\nDev" as JenkinsDev
participant "Jenkins Pipeline\nProd" as JenkinsProd
end box

participant "Solana \nblockchain" as Solana

box "Azure Runtime" #EAF7EA
participant "Azure Infrastructure" as Azure
participant "Corda Vault Web UI" as WebUI
participant "Corda Vault Backend" as Backend
end box

note over Dev,Backend
This diagram shows the high-level software supply chain from dependency intake
through source control, CI/CD, deployment, and hosted runtime components.
end note

== Dependency Intake ==

Dev -> Repos : Select package versions\n(npm crates, Cargo crates)
Repos --> Laptop : Deliver dependency artifacts\nand metadata
Laptop -> Laptop : R/W — resolve lockfiles\nand local build inputs

== Source Changes ==

Dev -> Laptop : Implement changes\nand update build manifests
Laptop -> GitHub : W — push commits, tags,\nand pipeline definitions
GitHub --> JenkinsDev : Trigger build\nand deployment workflow

== Build and Deploy to Dev ==

activate JenkinsDev
JenkinsDev -> GitHub : R — checkout source\nand pipeline configuration
JenkinsDev -> Repos : R — restore npm and Cargo\ndependencies
Repos --> JenkinsDev : Package artifacts
JenkinsDev -> Azure : W — deploy dev Web UI\nand backend artifacts
Azure -> WebUI : create — provision/update\ndev UI instance
Azure -> Backend : create — provision/update\ndev backend instance
JenkinsDev -> Solana : W — publish Solana\ndeployment payload when needed
Solana --> JenkinsDev : Deployment result\nand program identifiers
deactivate JenkinsDev

== Promotion to Production ==

Dev -> JenkinsProd : Approve or trigger\nproduction release
activate JenkinsProd
JenkinsProd -> GitHub : R — fetch approved\nrelease commit/tag
JenkinsProd -> Repos : R — restore pinned\ndependencies

alt Production deployment approved
	JenkinsProd -> Azure : W — deploy prod Web UI\nand backend artifacts
	Azure -> WebUI : create — provision/update\nprod UI instance
	Azure -> Backend : create — provision/update\nprod backend instance
	JenkinsProd -> Solana : W — execute production\nSolana deployment if required
	Solana --> JenkinsProd : Deployment confirmation
else Release blocked or validation fails
	JenkinsProd --> Dev : Reject release\nand require remediation
end

deactivate JenkinsProd

== Runtime Hosting ==

Azure -> WebUI : R/W — host static assets,\nTLS termination, edge routing
Azure -> Backend : R/W — host APIs, jobs,\nand service configuration
WebUI -> Backend : R/W — application traffic

@enduml
